{"id":"553707b7a7425e75","group":"92","path":"92/92-fact-henkin-sigma1.md","title":"fact-henkin-sigma1 — Henkin Sentence is Sigma 1","display":"fact-henkin-sigma1 — Henkin Sentence is Sigma_1","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-fact-henkin-sigma1","aliases":["92-fact-henkin-sigma1"],"display":"fact-henkin-sigma1 — Henkin Sentence is Sigma_1","depends_on":["[[92-df-henkin-sentence]]","[[92-df-sigma1-formula]]","[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-df-hbl-provability-predicate]]","[[92-df-logical-axiom]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-theory-set]]"],"source":"原书第 IX 章 P1 的本地推论；存在量词等式见证","source_status":"本地推论；附直接见证与证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-fact-henkin-sigma1"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-fact-henkin-sigma1</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-henkin-sigma1 — Henkin Sentence is Sigma_1"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"67317965f7ebd660\" href=\"?note=67317965f7ebd660\" title=\"92-df-henkin-sentence\">92-df-henkin-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8fd1dce21b2c65db\" href=\"?note=8fd1dce21b2c65db\" title=\"92-df-sigma1-formula\">92-df-sigma1-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"466c532d80d46a83\" href=\"?note=466c532d80d46a83\" title=\"92-df-hbl-provability-predicate\">92-df-hbl-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e948c25f4a467fa1\" href=\"?note=e948c25f4a467fa1\" title=\"92-df-logical-axiom\">92-df-logical-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"原书第 IX 章 P1 的本地推论；存在量词等式见证"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地推论；附直接见证与证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_G\\)</span> (Henkin-sentence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"67317965f7ebd660\" href=\"?note=67317965f7ebd660\" title=\"92-df-henkin-sentence\">92-df-henkin-sentence</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G\\)</span> (selected Sigma-1 formula and induced provability formula)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^G\">\\(\\Sigma_1^G\\)</span> (first existential level, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8fd1dce21b2c65db\" href=\"?note=8fd1dce21b2c65db\" title=\"92-df-sigma1-formula\">92-df-sigma1-formula</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> (固定 G 的算术强度；本证明用显式存在量词等式作见证)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>所选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G\\)</span> 满足 HBL 的 P1：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash A\">\\(G\\vdash A\\)</span> 蕴涵 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner A\\urcorner})\">\\(G\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner A\\urcorner})\\)</span>；见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"466c532d80d46a83\" href=\"?note=466c532d80d46a83\" title=\"92-df-hbl-provability-predicate\">92-df-hbl-provability-predicate</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}sigma1}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\land\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G\\land\n\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\cap\\Sigma_1^G\\;\n\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_G(H)\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}sigma1}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\land\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G\\land\n\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\cap\\Sigma_1^G\\;\n\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_G(H)\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在本库的可证等价定义下可直接选取一个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^G\">\\(\\Sigma_1^G\\)</span> Henkin句</li>\n<li>内部<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\)</span>由<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists v_1\\,\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\">\\(\\exists v_1\\,\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\)</span>得到；外部关系<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\)</span>不是公式</li>\n<li>不是每个只在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中满足Henkin固定点等价的任意见证都必须具有同一字面复杂度，因此把原来的全称断言改为规范见证的存在断言</li>\n<li>&quot;存在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>是我的证明&quot;</li>\n<li>Henkin句的可证性还需要<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>满足Löb定理所用的可证性条件，不能只由层级归类推出</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>可直接选择 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=\\exists v_0(v_0=v_0)\">\\(H=\\exists v_0(v_0=v_0)\\)</span>。它字面属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^G\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\Sigma_1^G\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span>。用闭项 0 作见证和等式逻辑，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash H\">\\(G\\vdash H\\)</span>；P1 给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner H\\urcorner})\">\\(G\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner H\\urcorner})\\)</span>。两个句子都可证，命题逻辑于是证明其双条件，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_G(H)\">\\(\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_G(H)\\)</span>。\n这给出原存在结论的完整数学证明，不需要预设复杂度保持对角图。对任意一个由一般对角引理取得的句子，仍不能仅凭可证等价断言其字面层级。这一直接见证依赖本库按可证等价定义 Henkin 固定点；不是对原书构造出的字符串声称相同。\n原书第 IX 章 pp.106–110 提供 P1 与 Henkin/Löb 背景。本地公式选择和上面的证明属于推论；未声称机器形式化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-henkin-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"67317965f7ebd660","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-henkin-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sigma1-formula","status":"resolved","id":"8fd1dce21b2c65db","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sigma1-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-hbl-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"466c532d80d46a83","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-hbl-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-logical-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"e948c25f4a467fa1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · dep